Z||000000||Xtreme Fiero's||08-22-2000||04:42 PM||||<BR>Well my car has died, The motor locked up on me. I'm not even pissed off, I would expect this to happen I raceed my car & it died. I reace my friend w/ a 88 auto GT I hung with him for a bit, then my car back fired and I had no power  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> I had to floor it to stay up to speed I pushed in the clutch to let the car idle to mabye cool down a little but it cut off  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I turned the key to start it up again but it was locked up so I put it in 4th and dumped the clutch both wheels locked up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> and now my car sits dead until i get the money for a 6-cyl.||||reg||13
