Z||000005||1FST2M6||08-23-2000||08:28 AM||||with the timing to advanced or retarded your computer would throw the car in the ever wonderful GM Safe mode. which will make the car run.. SLOW but still run.. I would trip my cars safe mode all the time with the MSD and nitrous i had.. easy way to fix was put a 2 pole switch at the power connection of the ECU and while coasting down a hill push in the clutch.. flip the switch.. car would shut off... wait a few seconds... turn the switch on pop the clutch and keep on crusin... Check engine light would go off and i was fine... untill i laid in to the nitrous for a long period again.. short stints are ok.. but real 1/4 mile runs and over 1/4 mile runs she didn't like...  Got any pics of your previous dead motor? hole in the block? or milky oil? chocolate looking coolant?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  ||||reg||1
